Final Caliber is a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]], the firearm maker. It is the Heart of the Org's berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], and joined the Party's network of hearts.
